					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							3602.893,
							506.535,
							4604.307
						],
						"pointId": 340100172
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							3606.844,
							506.533,
							4603.666
						],
						"pointId": 4415
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 240000101,
					"content": "I repeat...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Livre"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000102,
					"content": "Mr. Livre. I understand your request, and I'm willing to assist you to the best of my ability, but... Well, please look at this application...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cornelia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000103,
					"content": "The person in charge here is Mr. Clapiers. All the materials you previously submitted are his to sort and deal with. Apart from him, none of us are permitted to handle them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cornelia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000104,
					"content": "He's presently out on business. His official stamp is needed before your materials can enter our expenses calculation system.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cornelia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000105,
					"content": "Yeah, yeah! You know what? I've been here three times already — are you going to handle my case, or aren't you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Livre"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000106,
					"content": "Please calm down, Mr. Livre. There are only two people in Mr. Clapiers's office — the other is Mr. Monthois...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cornelia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000107,
					"content": "But he's getting on in years and is waiting to retire. In truth, he hasn't done any work in the office for a while now. He doesn't even draw a salary anymore.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cornelia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000108,
					"content": "Then I'll just go to the office and make the old man stamp my stuff. Archons, I'll stamp them myself if I must!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Livre"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000109,
					"content": "I'm very sorry, but that won't do. First, it contravenes the rules, and second, the key to the stamp is with Mr. Clapiers, and only he can access it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cornelia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000110,
					"content": "As for me, I have other things to attend to as well... Please believe me when I say that Mr. Clapiers will return and help you settle this matter today.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cornelia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000111,
					"content": "...Alright. Have a good day, Ms. Cornelia.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Livre"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000112,
					"content": "And you too, Mr. Livre.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Cornelia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000113,
					"content": "Cornelia leaves in a hurry...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240000114,
					"content": "Looks like I'll have to go home empty-handed, huh... *sigh*",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000115,
						240000116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Livre"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000115,
					"content": "What's happened?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240000117,
					"content": "Nothing, really. I just wasted my time — half a day, to be precise.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Livre"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000118,
					"content": "I've had it up to here with this Clapiers! The Palais Mermonia ordered a few clockwork meka from us, but they have yet to pay for them!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Livre"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000119,
					"content": "The first time I came to look for him, he told me that the office was doing an internal end-of-month audit, and could only dispense funds to external parties next month — as such, my application could not be processed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Livre"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000120,
					"content": "The second time I came, he claimed that they were out of stamp pad ink, and their supplier's ink warehouse had caught fire, which meant that they needed to purchase some elsewhere. This in turn meant that my application could not be stamped.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Livre"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000121,
					"content": "The third time, he claimed that this External Assisting Personnel Registration Form had been updated and needed to be filled out again — and of course, they were out of forms, and new ones would only come in tomorrow.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Livre"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000122,
					"content": "I was going to come in today and get one, but now he isn't even in the office. Archons...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Livre"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000123,
					"content": "Hmm? Mr. Livre? Why do you look so upset? Can I help you with anything?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000124,
					"content": "Officer Rhemia! It's so good to see you. This is what happened...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Livre"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000125,
					"content": "The story comes spilling out of Livre's rambling mouth...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000126
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240000126,
					"content": "Ah, Mr. Clapiers... He's not easy to get a hold of, for sure, but he really is on Erinnyes at the moment, and not in the Palais Mermonia.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000127,
					"content": "Regardless, however, let's get the form for you first.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000128,
					"content": "Eh? But Clapiers said that there weren't any more forms...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Livre"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000129,
					"content": "I have a way to help solve your problem. As I recall, some stores that have long-term arrangements with the Palais Mermonia have encountered the same issue you have.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000130,
					"content": "Their solution is to regularly come to the Palais from time to time to collect forms and documents they might need.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000131,
					"content": "This makes completing and submitting forms easier and quicker on the one hand, and keeps them abreast of changes made to said documents on the other... \"It pays to be prepared,\" as they say.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000132,
					"content": "Is... that how all the forms disappeared?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Livre"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000133,
					"content": "And that's why I'd say that these stores must have those extra forms, so let's pay them a visit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000134,
					"content": "Besides, I'm sure they'd be more than willing to help out once they've heard of your futile trips to the Palais.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000135,
					"content": "Ah, yes. We'd best get the forms you need, fill them out, then bring them to Mr. Clapiers's office before office hours at the Palais end.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000136,
					"content": "Would you be willing to help out, Traveler?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000137,
					"content": "Traveler, please, help me! If I cannot get this done, I fear that another sleepless night awaits!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000138,
						240000139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Livre"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000138,
					"content": "Alright...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000140
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240000140,
					"content": "You just need to check out these two stores and try to borrow the newest version of the External Assisting Personnel Registration Form.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000141,
					"content": "Let me see...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000142
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000142,
					"content": "Please go to Estelle's smithy and Caron's clock shop.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000143
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000143,
					"content": "Not long ago, the former helped the Palais repair street lamps, while the latter was involved in adjusting their clock.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000144
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000144,
					"content": "They often take assignments from the Palais, so they're certain to have a form on them somewhere.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000145
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000145,
					"content": "We'll be counting on your help regarding those locations, and in the meantime, Livre and I will split up and go to other shops.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Rhemia"
				},
				{
					"id": 240000139,
					"content": "But what do I need to do?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000140
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 240000116,
					"content": "What have you encountered?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						240000117
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 2400002,
			"completionStepIds": [
				2400002
